   "en": "Bandit",
   "term": "null"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0005",
   "jp": "{FFEE}エリオットとレティシアを守れ！{FFF1}",
   "en": "{FFEE}Protect Elliot and Leticia!{FFF1}",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0006",
   "jp": "{v:0030}ぼ、僕はどうすれば良いのでしょうか？",
   "en": "{v:0030}W-what should I do?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0007",
   "jp": "どう指示しますか？",
   "en": "What orders will you give?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0008",
   "jp": "・その場で防御させる",
   "en": "・Defend where you are",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0009",
   "jp": "・敵を攻撃させる",
   "en": "・Attack the enemy",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0010",
   "jp": "・こちらへ来させる",
   "en": "・Come over here",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0011",
   "jp": "・パーティーの誰かに追従させる",
   "en": "・Follow a party member",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0012",
   "jp": "どこを通らせて、こちらへ来させますか？",
   "en": "Which route should he take to reach you?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0013",
   "jp": "・南へ向かう通路の左側",
   "en": "・Left side of the path heading south",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0014",
   "jp": "・南へ向かう通路の右側",
   "en": "・Right side of the path heading south",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0015",
   "jp": "・池の上にある通路",
   "en": "・The path over the pond",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0016",
   "jp": "このルートで良いですか？",
   "en": "Is this route all right?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0017",
   "jp": "誰の後を追従させますか？",
   "en": "Who should he follow?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0018",
   "jp": "・{s:0000}",
   "en": "・{s:0000}",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0019",
   "jp": "・ルイセ",
   "en": "・Luise",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0020",
   "jp": "・ウォレス",
   "en": "・Wallace",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0021",
   "jp": "・ミーシャ",
   "en": "・Misha",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0022",
   "jp": "{s:0000}を追従させますか？",
   "en": "Have him follow {s:0000}?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0023",
   "jp": "{v:0031}わかりました！",
   "en": "{v:0031}Understood!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0024",
   "jp": "{s:0000}さんは、いませんけど‥‥。",
   "en": "But {s:0000} isn't here...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0025",
   "jp": "ルイセを追従させますか？",
   "en": "Have him follow Luise?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0026",
   "jp": "ルイセさんは、いませんけど‥‥。",
   "en": "But Luise-san isn't here...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0027",
   "jp": "ウォレスを追従させますか？",
   "en": "Have him follow Wallace?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0028",
   "jp": "ウォレスさんは、いませんけど‥‥。",
   "en": "But Wallace-san isn't here...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0029",
   "jp": "ミーシャを追従させますか？",
   "en": "Have him follow Misha?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0030",
   "jp": "ミーシャさんは、いませんけど‥‥。",
   "en": "But Misha-san isn't here...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0031",
   "jp": "{v:002F}姫は下がっててね！{n}アタシたちが何とかするから！",
   "en": "{v:002F}Stay back, Princess! We'll handle this!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0032",
   "jp": "{v:001C}はい。",
   "en": "{v:001C}Yes.",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0033",
   "jp": "{v:0032}やはり本物の姫だ‥‥。{n}奴らが連れ戻したのか‥‥。{p}{v:0033}となれば‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0032}It really is the princess... So they brought her back...{p}{v:0033}In that case...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0034",
   "jp": "{v:0034}無事に帰れたと思っているようだな。",
   "en": "{v:0034}You seem to think you've made it home safely.",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0035",
   "jp": "{v:0035}えっ？",
   "en": "{v:0035}Huh?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0036",
   "jp": "‥‥{v:0036}まあ、死ぬ場所が変わっただけのことだ。{n}覚悟しろ。",
   "en": "...{v:0036}Well, all you've changed is where you'll die. Prepare{n}yourselves.",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0037",
   "jp": "{v:0008}もぉ～～！{n}ドジなんだからぁ！",
   "en": "{v:0008}Ughhh! You're such a klutz!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0038",
   "jp": "{v:005B}お兄ちゃんごめんね‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:005B}I'm sorry, Big Brother...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0039",
   "jp": "{v:0016}すまん‥‥不覚をとった‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0016}Sorry... Let my guard down...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0040",
   "jp": "{v:007E}ふみぃ‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:007E}Fwhee...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0041",
   "jp": "{v:0037}きゃああっ！",
   "en": "{v:0037}Aaaah!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0042",
   "jp": "{v:0038}ああっ！{n}そんな‥‥",
   "en": "{v:0038}Ah! No...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0043",
   "jp": "{v:0039}うわぁっ！",
   "en": "{v:0039}Uwaaah!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0044",
   "jp": "{v:003A}バカ、バカ！{n}何やってんのよ！",
   "en": "{v:003A}Idiot! Idiot! What are you doing?!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0045",
   "jp": "いや～っ！",
   "en": "Nooo!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0046",
   "jp": "そ、そんなひどい‥‥。",
   "en": "H-how could you...?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0047",
   "jp": "まだ死にたくない‥‥",
   "en": "I don't want to die yet...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0048",
   "jp": "あぁ‥‥。{n}空が青い‥‥",
   "en": "Ah... The sky is so blue...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0049",
   "jp": "ぼ、僕、もうダメ‥‥",
   "en": "I-I can't go on...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0050",
   "jp": "もっと遊びたかったよ‥‥",
   "en": "I wanted to play some more...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0051",
   "jp": "うぅ‥‥。{n}寒いよ～‥‥",
   "en": "Ooh... I'm so cold...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0052",
   "jp": "{v:003D}グッ！{n}やはり‥‥まぐれではなかったか‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:003D}Guh! So... it wasn't a fluke after all...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0053",
   "jp": "{v:003F}ああ、逃げられちゃう！",
   "en": "{v:003F}Oh, he's getting away!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0054",
   "jp": "{v:0040}ぐぅぅ‥‥。{n}なぜ勝てねぇ‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0040}Grrgh... Why can't I win...?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0055",
   "jp": "{v:0046}もう敵はいないよね？",
   "en": "{v:0046}That's all the enemies, right?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0056",
   "jp": "{v:0047}ふぅっ、助かった‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0047}Whew... I'm safe...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0057",
   "jp": "{v:003C}行くぞ、卑怯者‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:003C}Here I come, coward...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0058",
   "jp": "{v:003B}なかなかやるな‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:003B}You're good...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0059",
   "jp": "{v:0048}行くぞ！",
   "en": "{v:0048}Here I come!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0060",
   "jp": "‥‥{v:003E}後は任せるぞ‥‥。{n}絶対に任務は果たせ‥‥。",
   "en": "...{v:003E}I'll leave the rest to you... Complete the mission, no{n}matter what...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0061",
   "jp": "{v:00A3}みなさんのおかげで、助かりました。",
   "en": "{v:00A3}You all saved my life.",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0062",
   "jp": "{v:0041}これ以上失敗できねぇぞ‥‥。{FFF9}{FFFB}{n}{v:0042}野郎ども、絶対にそいつらを殺せ！",
   "en": "{v:0041}We can't afford to screw up again...{FFF9}{FFFB}{v:0042}Boys, make damn{n}sure you kill them!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0063",
   "jp": "{v:0043}へいっ！",
   "en": "{v:0043}Yeah, boss!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0064",
   "jp": "{v:0044}ええい、こんなことで命を捨てられるか！{n}金は返す！{n}この仕事はキャンセルだ！",
   "en": "{v:0044}Damn it! I'm not throwing my life away for this! I'll give{n}the money back! This job's off!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0065",
   "jp": "{v:0045}使えぬ男だ‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0045}Useless man...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0066",
   "jp": "何で俺様がザコのように扱われるんだ‥‥",
   "en": "How'd a big shot like me get treated like small fry...?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0067",
   "jp": "し、死ぬ‥‥",
   "en": "I-I'm dying...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0068",
   "jp": "ちくしょう！",
   "en": "Damn it!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0069",
   "jp": "い、いてぇ～！{n}た、助けてくれ～！",
   "en": "O-owww! H-help me!",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0070",
   "jp": "な、何か俺、かっこわるい‥‥",
   "en": "I-I must look pretty pathetic...",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0071",
   "jp": "どう指示しますか？",
   "en": "What orders will you give?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0072",
   "jp": "・敵を攻撃させる",
   "en": "・Attack the enemy",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0073",
   "jp": "・パーティーの誰かに追従させる",
   "en": "・Follow a party member",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  },
  {
   "id": "scen176.0074",
   "jp": "・その場で防御させる",
   "en": "・Defend where you are",
   "term": "end",
   "unref": true
  }
 ]
}
